{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3f2c1686e744ed55ccad748da217e1c53de0ee596a6decb631fdd1677b77152", "ja": "うーん。\nそろそろ、使った資料を整理しないとな……。", "zh": "嗯……\n该整理一下用过的资料了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "6e3c7aa832d5606ac24eb80c1a7163f5f3a551dc20c7713e22ed99438fe42655", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n……机の周り、なんだか散らかってませんか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n……这桌子看起来是不是有点乱呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b772ec6473bcfecde25029667b28fa320b3f5bfb889e7ea7eb30e117a6479028", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。\nああ、今から片付けようと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n对啊，我正打算要收拾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "008394c1a0a11842fa327e51ff7483c76abbea8926e078d5f5436af90d208119", "ja": "本当ですか？\nもう、雑誌をこんなに溜めて……。", "zh": "真的吗？\n真是的，堆了这么多本杂志……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "54510334555f2926d2756c6551b7744f4ca0eb3ada91e7bcfe436c1679e0addb", "ja": "ええと……最新号、ラブラブ・デート特集？\nふたりで行きたいトキメキスポット……。", "zh": "我看看……最新一期《你侬我侬约会特辑》？\n情侣想去的约会圣地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "5f52709ba6589a462883237f7af2267addc1071e4304b37c97cf472ec0203270", "ja": "あの。{$P$}って、\nこういうのに興味があるんですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，\n你对这种东西有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0be7b69b95950efc3b6a70113d66d160016716d904d7759de06690ce3c8dc66b", "ja": "いや、これはみんなの資料にと思って買っただけで……\n結局そんなに使わなかったけど。", "zh": "不是，我只是为了大家才买来当参考资料的……\n但也没用上几次就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b2d5f3ec79509a8e5e25bec48b29df8112a051814b040085a0d31afe4390228c", "ja": "静香が欲しいなら、持っていっていいよ。\n色々、参考になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "要是静香你想要，就给你吧。\n我想应该有不少内容能让你参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "bdff1e34d14d75887c19b8265cb006c871cef5c1308b61ae761ff618491ae784", "ja": "えっ。さ、参考、ですか……。", "zh": "咦？参、参考吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7326413987dd526f7524be73fe633f98507ce6a537ca2db8012f8e84e55ef822", "ja": "静香？", "zh": "静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "592dc74e357ebf41f1ec685655dee98d346d6d72f22cda066498276f9c763cca", "ja": "あの、{$P$}！　こういうのって、\n私たちにはまだ、早いんじゃないかと思います！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}！\n我觉得这种事，对我们来说还太早了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b7ed81f7da4ab1fadf3d83c687be9d14ddfd3d9c61391bd453d39399561c378", "ja": "あ、アイドルには恋愛やデートをするヒマなんて、\nそんなの……全然、全然ありませんから！", "zh": "我、我们偶像根本没有时间\n去谈恋爱、约会之类的……绝对、绝对没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "93fdcd55dab434add4cf5468481fc53db800fdc4f1a9914af0b30ca3ed6cb31f", "ja": "だから{$P$}も、\n真面目に仕事してくださいっ。", "zh": "所以{$P$}，\n也请你专心在自己的工作上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1013_p", "source_sha256": "317eaf624e0bc26e6f3baf4623f7b2f733ea24143b29d5b619a4e7d0fb2f3a00", "ja": "恋心を勉強するくらいなら、いいんじゃないか？\n普通に遊びに行くのにも、使えそうだし……。", "zh": "了解一下爱慕的心情应该无妨吧？\n而且就算是单纯出去玩，感觉也派得上用场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "aad4b2ddbc0805344f9ac324432cd39f61cc9902a8a3eb57e04a782296ad39e3", "ja": "またそんなことを言って……{$P$}、\n本当は遊びたいだけなんじゃないんですか？", "zh": "又在讲这种话……{$P$}，\n我看你其实只是想去玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1015_p", "source_sha256": "756074e4211a87e7086a2fc0ebfb00247e7c76a088841b4dbdce47aa072cf5f4", "ja": "はは、そうかもしれないな。\nわかった、静香がいらないなら、捨てるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，或许是呢。\n好啦，既然静香你不需要，那我就扔掉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e652d617ac27ca9d4a1fe387e5d0ef5c5806302196cd5659e1f9f44dbe29097", "ja": "そ、そうですか。……じゃあ\nこの雑誌は、私が片付けておきます。", "zh": "要、要扔掉吗……那么，\n我来负责处理这本杂志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "2a794fbb9dcb56c5f50c419f4b4e745c6337064d99b459fbac630045815ff42b", "ja": "持って帰るわけじゃありませんよ！？　その、\n昴と百合子が、参考にするかもしれないから……。", "zh": "我可不是要拿回家喔！！只是说，\n也许能让昴和百合子拿去参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1018_p", "source_sha256": "caae77e455339a26dcfdb647998c69376b78e63f461dd82d8a35f5d05627f3ec", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nそうだな、ふたりも参考にするかもしれないしな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n也对，或许能让她们俩参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "77a347ab1699f746fa0f0be4e4f05e0198b6c55bf4e2bce06c5b53c9811ca53b", "ja": "はい。そういうわけですから、この雑誌は\n私が控え室に持っていっておきます。", "zh": "没错，那我就把这本杂志\n拿到准备室去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0123_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "e2ad8814a8e9f96fe17d587873fae40fdeb442120ef6573127d0efcbb2721985", "ja": "{$P$}は、しっかり\n机を片付けておいてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你要记得把桌面整理干净！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
